{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果公司宣佈將在土耳其啓動一項多年投資計劃，通過建設多座開發者學院及先進制造培訓設施，進一步擴大其在教育和產業培訓領域的佈局。該計劃共涵蓋七個培訓與開發機構，包括五所蘋果開發者學院、位於伊斯坦布爾的開發者中心，以及位於安卡拉的先進制造中心。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585666.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.341903+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T19:52:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:33:58.536548+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"4a9fa850fcaa8ac9f7e8aaa5c7748351a64938be260e121532b02d7f0b9bb6f6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}